# Generated by `npm run bake -w @portfolio/web`, and regenerated by `npm run
# build` before every deploy. Derived output, not source: the source is
# ice-texture.js and terrain.js. Committing it would put 4MB of binaries in the
# history and replace all of them wholesale on every retune.
#
# A fresh clone therefore has no bake, and `npm run dev` does not create one.
# The site still runs — it falls back to generating at load, which is what it
# did before and takes about seventeen seconds. Run `npm run bake -w
# @portfolio/web` once after cloning to get the fast path.
apps/web/public/baked/
